1
00:00:00,875 --> 00:00:04,165
(Sheldon:)But returning to your key conundrum,
you should call a locksmith.

2
00:00:04,337 --> 00:00:06,217
(Sheldon:)- Have him open the door for you.
- I did.

3
00:00:06,381 --> 00:00:08,511
(Penny:)He said he'll get here when he gets here.

4
00:00:08,675 --> 00:00:12,265
(Sheldon:)You're frustrated because he phrased
his reply in a meaningless tautology?

5
00:00:12,428 --> 00:00:16,478
No. I am frustrated
because I am a failure at everything...

6
00:00:16,641 --> 00:00:19,891
(Penny:)...and my breath smells like fly.

7
00:00:20,061 --> 00:00:21,311
[CRYING]

8
00:00:23,523 --> 00:00:24,983
(Sheldon:)There, there.

9
00:00:32,490 --> 00:00:35,200
(Sheldon:)Would you prefer to wait
in our apartment?

10
00:00:35,368 --> 00:00:38,828
No, I'd rather sit on this freezing floor,
sobbing like a 3-year-old.

11
00:00:39,581 --> 00:00:41,461
All right, then.

12
00:00:42,167 --> 00:00:44,457
(Penny:)For God's sake.

13
00:00:46,671 --> 00:00:51,021
(Sheldon:)Just when I think I've gotten
the hang of sarcasm.

